# LAONEI'S OWN NAME — laonei.co, and www.
#
# Somebody who hears "Laonei" types laonei.co, and until this it answered
# nothing: after an Instagram push, that is a person lost at the door. The
# app itself lives at liuxuesheng.help (on its own server, the StudyPal
# side), so this only forwards there, keeping the path and any ?from= tag
# so the Numbers page can still say where they came from.
#
# 302, not 301: if the app later moves to laonei.co itself, phones that
# remembered a permanent redirect would keep going to the old name.
#
# Needs one DNS record at the registrar: A, host empty (the bare domain) →
# this box; www the same, or a CNAME to laonei.co. Until then Caddy logs
# that it cannot get a certificate and every other site carries on.
{$TOMSCODING_LAONEI_DOMAIN:laonei.localhost} {
	redir https://liuxuesheng.help{uri} 302
}
